## 📦 Tariff & HS Code Classification Guide

Tradexpress integrates automated and manual product classification tools to map inventory and digital assets against international Harmonized System (HS) codes.

### Supported Classifications
- **AI Hardware & Accelerators:** `8471.80` (Processing/Computing Units), `8473.80` (Component parts).
- **Embedded Electronics & Storage:** `8542.31` (Processors/Controllers), `8523.49` (Digital storage media).
- **Consulting & Digital Services:** Mapped against standardized service taxonomy and WCO compliance frameworks.

### Versioning & Development Status
- **Initial Development (`0.y.z`):** Rapid iteration phase. Start at `0.1.0` and increment the minor version for each functional release.
- **Stable Release (`1.0.0`):** Promoted to production once core APIs and dependent integrations are locked and stable.
